/**
 * WikiEquipmentEnricher.ts
 *
 * Structured parser for RS Wiki Infobox templates and drop tables.
 * Extracts equipment bonuses, item metadata, monster stats, and complete
 * drop tables (including sub-table resolution) with respectful rate limiting.
 *
 * Sovereign Substrate: Semantic Enrichment Layer
 * Cache Authority: D:\sovereign\atlas\wiki\cache\
 *
 * Template Coverage:
 *   - {{Infobox Bonuses}}  → Equipment combat stats
 *   - {{Infobox Item}}     → Item metadata
 *   - {{Infobox Monster}}  → Monster/NPC stats
 *   - {{DropsLine}}        → Individual drop entries
 *   - {{Rare drop table}}, {{Gem drop table}}, etc. → Sub-table resolution
 */

